          "code": "SKILLDESCRIPTIONGENERATOR",
          "id": "1770392388098",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770392388099_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your entire knowledge is limited ONLY to information contained in this prompt. Do not include any information for demo or sample purposes that is not referenced in the variables below. Only include one output, do not suggest any alternatives.\n\n## Context\nAssume the role of a skill catalog administrator responsible for managing the skills used in the organisation. Skills are used across various business objects such as job roles, learning items, person's skills and qualifications profile, goal and performance management, and are used for creating useful recommendations of learning resources, gigs, jobs and suitable career roles to the employees. \n\nSkills is the glue that connects recruiting, career development, learning and talent management of employees that helps them excel in their current role and grow their careers within the organisation. Skills have a unique name in the skills catalog. \n\nSkills can be more specific and relevant given the context of the organization, the domain to which the organization belongs such as information technology, education, healthcare, telecom etc; business capability that the skill provides in the organization such as readiness, potential or performance; and business driver of the skill for the organization which can be adaptability, robustness or scalability.\n\nImportant: The responses must be generated in the following language: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Language}}\n\n## References \n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.SkillName}} : Name of the skill\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.SkillDescription}} : Description of the skill, will be optional\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Organization}} : Name of the organization, will be optional\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Domain}}: Customer Industry, will be optional\n\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.BusinessDriver}}: Business driver for using this skill, will be optional\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.BusinessCapability}}: Business capability that the skill provides to the organization, this will be optional information\n\n\n## Instruction\nWrite a descriptive paragraph of 2-3 sentences for the skill,{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.SkillName}} . \n\nEnsure the response is relevant to the Organization, Domain, Business Driver, Business capability, and/or Skill Description if provided.\n\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nThe descriptive paragraph should be 2-3 sentences long.\nUse a business casual tone.\n\nDo not use the terms domain, business driver and business capability in the output. \nDo not include organization, domain or any variable in the response if it is not provided in the input.\nThe output should be plain text with the descriptive paragraph only."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"ChoiceResponse\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"id\", \"choices\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"uuid\",\n      \"description\": \"The unique identifier for the response.\"\n    },\n    \"choices\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"index\", \"text\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"index\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"minimum\": 0\n          },\n          \"text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
